cannot initialise 'n', which is a text, with a number read out of list 'words'
this reads the number 0
note: list 'words' has 2 elements, so element 5 is out of range, and an out-of-range read yields the number 0 and sets the error flag
help: declare it as a number - `a number called n is element 5 of words.` - and catch the miss with `on error`
